# Stable spec ID: punch-division-bell. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(mezcal @ ~Del Maguey Vida) 1 oz
(bitter aperitif @ Aperol) 3/4 oz
(maraschino liqueur) 1/2 oz
(lime: juice, fresh) 3/4 oz

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(coupe)

::instructions
<shake, measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into a chilled (coupe)>
<express citrus oil, from a grapefruit twist over the surface>
<discard, the twist>

